title: Game Over.
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
audio: music/TchaikovskyQuartet2.ogg
on-arrival: {!
// Achievements:
this.achieve('game_completed');

if (Q.dreamteam == 1) {
    this.achieve('golden_age_of_the_peoples_commissars');
}
!}


= End

@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.

@dreamteam
title: Golden Age of the People's Commissars
view-if: dreamteam = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We assembled an all-star composition in the Council of People's Commissars. 







@achievements
title: Achievements
tags: endings
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu if started == 1; root.start_menu_2 if started == 0

= Completed Achievements in this Playthrough

[? if game_achievement_golden_age_of_the_peoples_commissars:
{!
<tr>
<td style="width: 60px; height: 60px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; border: 2px solid #c00000; background-color: rgba(192, 0, 0, 0.1);">
<img src="img/achievement/eiserne_front.png" alt="Iron Front Icon"
style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
</td>
<td style="border: 2px solid #c00000; background-color: rgba(91, 154, 141, 0.1);">
<div style="padding-left: 0.5em;">
<div style="font-weight: bold;">Golden Age of the People's Commissars</div>
<div style="font-size: 90%; color: #444;"> - Assemble an all-star composition in the Council of People's Commissars.</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
!}
?]

